# Installation Instructions

Please refer to the [README.md](README.md) for detailed build and installation instructions.

## Prerequisites

- CMake (3.10+)
- Ninja or Make
- C/C++ Compiler (GCC or Clang)
- Raku (rakudo) and zef
- mtools (for OS image generation)
- QEMU (for testing OS images)

## Quick Start

1. Install dependencies:
   ```bash
   sudo apt-get install cmake ninja-build clang lld libc6-dev-i386 linux-headers-generic bison flex libfl-dev coreutils mtools rakudo
   ```

2. Setup `rakusk` assembler:
   ```bash
   ./scripts/setup_rakusk.sh
   ```

3. Build the project:
   ```bash
   mkdir build
   cd build
   cmake -G Ninja ..
   ninja